  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Is it true that the membership problem is undecidable for any semidirect\nproduct Fn ⋋ Fn of non-abelian free groups Fn ?\n   An affirmative answer would imply an answer to 6.24. Recall that the mem-\nbership problem is decidable for Fn (M. Hall, 1949) and undecidable for Fn × Fn\n(K. A. Mikhailova, 1958).                                        V. G. Bardakov",
